  "fullDescription": "Level up your creative projects with retro digital energy, futuristic distortion, and classic arcade nostalgia with SHIVER GLITCH! Masterfully constructed with blocky pixel grid geometry and subtle glitch distortion accents, this pixelated display font captures the raw aesthetic of 8-bit video games and futuristic cyber culture.\n\nWhether you’re designing gaming logos, Twitch overlays, retro arcade merchandise, cyberpunk poster headlines, music album covers, or custom vinyl craft SVG projects, SHIVER GLITCH gives your typography an unshakeable digital edge.",
